            "title": "Logo Redesign",
            "summary": "Webbs wanted to become a serious competitor for brands like Crumble and Great American. One major issue was their logo&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Webbs wanted to become a serious competitor for brands like Crumble and Great American. One major issue was their logo and branding didn't feel like it really matched their target audience. The goal was to feel warm and inviting while still feeling polished and more premium.</p>\n<p>While designing they realized the needed a new brochure created to reflect their new pricing and branding.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Before:</h3>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" sizes=\"(min-width: 37.5em) 1600px, 80vw\" srcset=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/logo-xs.png 384w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/logo-sm.png 600w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/logo-md.png 768w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/logo-lg.png 1200w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/logo-xl.png 1600w\"></figure>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>After:</h3>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/Webbs-brown.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1583\" height=\"1075\" sizes=\"(min-width: 37.5em) 1600px, 80vw\" srcset=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/Webbs-brown-xs.jpg 384w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/Webbs-brown-sm.jpg 600w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/Webbs-brown-md.jpg 768w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/Webbs-brown-lg.jpg 1200w ,https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/responsive/Webbs-brown-xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/before-after.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/before-after-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Before and after transformation\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/variations.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/variations-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Logo Variations\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Webbs-Copy.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Webbs-Copy-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Alternate logo for darker backgrounds\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/colorpalette.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/colorpalette-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Custom Color Palette with Pantone, Hex codes, CMYK, as well as RGB\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-21-133328.png\" data-size=\"1053x1113\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-21-133328-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"812\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/pattern-light.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/pattern-light-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Webbs-brown-patern-Copy.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/Webbs-brown-patern-Copy-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/mockups.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/mockups-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"Mockups for uniforms and packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure-front.png\" data-size=\"1999x1545\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure-front-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"New Menu/ Tri-fold Brochure side 1\" width=\"768\" height=\"594\"></a>\n<figcaption>front</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure-inside.png\" data-size=\"1999x1545\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure-inside-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"New Menu/ Tri-fold Brochure side 2\" width=\"768\" height=\"594\"></a>\n<figcaption>back</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure.png\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/3/gallery/brochure-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
