        {
            "id": "https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/lawncare-service-booking-site.html",
            "url": "https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/lawncare-service-booking-site.html",
            "title": "Branding + Website package",
            "summary": "Lawncare Service Booking Site Marcus was getting by with a logo thrown together by his cousin. It got the job&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Lawncare Service Booking Site</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/Untitled-design-2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></figure>\n<h3>Backstory: </h3>\n<div>\n<p>Marcus was getting by with a logo thrown together by his cousin. <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">It got the job done for the past 3 years and allowed him to start building his client base. </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">But now he’s wanting to bid for commercial clients and his current logo just wasn't cutting it…</span></p>\n<div>\n<p>He wants his branding to look professional and established for this next phase in business. And he needs a website that will start allowing him to book commercial contracts more frequently.</p>\n<p><strong>It's time for an upgrade so that his branding and website match the level of clientele he's seeking to work with.</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Branding:</h3>\n<p>I generally present 3-4 initial concepts for branding. This helps to drive the design direction to make sure that I really get to the essence of the design and create something that feels like \"you\". In this case the client was very happy during that first round. If there were design notes we would have done up to 2 more rounds of concepts to make sure we were on the same page.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"The client's initial logo design\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a>\n<figcaption>Client did not have a brand system in place, only an ai generated logo created by their younger cousin.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign2.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"I present 3-4 design concepts\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a>\n<figcaption>During these revision rounds we narrow down the design to something that feels intentional and aligned with the business owner's vision.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign3.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"We have a winner!\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a>\n<figcaption>Client loved the design so we moved forward with crafting a system around it. Color palette, different variations, font selection, and of course a brand guide.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign4.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign4-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign5.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign5-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign6.png\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Logo-Redesign6-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Website Design</h3>\n<p>After branding is clarified I move on to the website design. Marcus wanted something that was professional,  clean and easy to navigate. This website features 4 main pages as shown in the navigation. There was also an <strong>add-on</strong> for local SEO. I built out 5 additional pages, a specific page dedicated to each city that they service to ensure they are more easily found by potential local clients.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"1\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140049-3.png\" data-size=\"2040x1231\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140049-3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"463\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140137-3.png\" data-size=\"2062x1189\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140137-3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"443\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140147.png\" data-size=\"2254x1326\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140147-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"452\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140201.png\" data-size=\"2587x1276\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140201-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"379\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140209.png\" data-size=\"2779x1204\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140209-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"333\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140218.png\" data-size=\"2365x1363\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140218-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"443\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140230.png\" data-size=\"2323x1210\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140230-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"400\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140238.png\" data-size=\"2376x1147\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140238-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"371\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140315.png\" data-size=\"2059x1141\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/2/gallery/Screenshot-2026-07-20-140315-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"426\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
