            "summary": "Custom Website With Ecommerce Functionality Custom branding that is used on social media, digital products, and a website. The website&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Custom Website With Ecommerce Functionality</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/Becca-Wingrove.gif\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/Becca-Wingrove.gif\" alt=\"A website and and custom branding crafted for a coach and influencer\"></a>\n<figcaption>Custom branding that is used on social media, digital products, and a website. The website features ecommerce functionality to sell and deliver digital product ebook.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/branding.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1080\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/branding-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Branding for a coach and influencer\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>Custom logo, Alternative versions of logo for different spaces and use-cases, Custom color palette to be used for social media, website, and other branded materials</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/hero.jpg\" data-size=\"1080x714\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/hero-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"508\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/features-trust-information.png\" data-size=\"1080x720\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/features-trust-information-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/breakout-quote-or-testimonial.jpg\" data-size=\"1080x379\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/breakout-quote-or-testimonial-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"270\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/the-offer-and-cta.jpg\" data-size=\"1080x510\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/the-offer-and-cta-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"363\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/shopping.jpg\" data-size=\"1080x825\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://sarahwilsonconsulting.github.io/publiiportfolio/media/posts/1/gallery/shopping-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"587\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
